{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20057","headline":"忆周秀才素上人时闻各在一方 · 孟郊","name":"忆周秀才素上人时闻各在一方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东西分我情，魂梦安能定。\n野客云作心，高僧月爲性。\n浮云自高闲，明月常空净。\n衣敝得古风，居山无俗病。\n吟听碧云语，手把青松柄。\n羡尔欲寄书，飞禽杳难倩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}